"c37" value="cdk deploy" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#545B64;strokeWidth=1.6;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;Division of authority&lt;/b&gt; — the image is authoritative for &lt;b&gt;what&lt;/b&gt; (app code + stage definitions); the deploy.config.ts target for &lt;b&gt;where&lt;/b&gt; (account, regions, forced role); config/&amp;lt;stage&amp;gt;.json for &lt;b&gt;which version&lt;/b&gt;. Same image + same config ⇒ same template, so rollback is pointing a version file at the previous tag." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#545B64;spacing=6;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="840" width="1580" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>